{"3612730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Destined Notes : The Written Fate", "steam_appid": 3612730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4774550], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612730/extras/3f5e9b37fad8e5e89de2bff6e5f9bbad.avif?t=1787883415\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WRITTEN FATE</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Story of Grief… That Refuses to Stay Buried</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daniel was once a man of reason—a paranormal investigator who sought his answers in the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until the night he lost his wife, Alisa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was meant to be just another case became something far more personal… something that shattered his world. Since then, Daniel has lived in the shadow of that haunted not just by spirits, but by guilt.<br>Day-By-Day his conditions worsen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when a call comes in from a fellow officer about a brutal, unexplainable incident…<br>One that mirrors the very horror that took Alisa—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daniel has no choice but to return.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612730/extras/956339de93acea8dceb6bb18dd8467d4.avif?t=1787883415\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Investigation Begins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts inside a seemingly ordinary <strong>murder house</strong> quickly unravels into something far deeper. Whispers echo where no one stands. Shadows move where light should exist. And the dead… refuse to stay silent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Daniel digs deeper, the case pulls him beyond the house—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➡ Into the Unknown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➡ Into a cursed forest<br>➡ Down into suffocating caves<br>➡ And toward a truth that was never meant to be uncovered</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just survival, but also one's confrontation to his written fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First-Person Paranormal Investigation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search environments, uncover hidden clues, and piece together a fragmented narrative.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Psychological Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mind is your greatest enemy. What you see… may not be real.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supernatural Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the final moments of lost souls and interact with echoes of the past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environmental Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock paths, perform rituals, and break through the unknown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinematic Storytelling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply personal narrative driven by loss, fear, and revelation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612730/extras/61c0cdbeda3a94758639d022c99b5521.avif?t=1787883415\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Journey Through Fear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From tight corridors of a blood-stained home…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To the Unknown,<br>To the suffocating silence of a deadly forest…<br>To the darkness beneath the earth—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location brings you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And further away from sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Truth About Alisa</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This was never just a case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was nits and dots, all connected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every clue, every vision, every encounter—<br>Leads back to <strong>her</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612730/extras/794b1c65ad99cb22bcb8c81423deb174.avif?t=1787883415\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will You Find Answers… or Become One?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some stories should remain untold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some truths should remain buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Daniel is already too far gone.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612730/extras/3f5e9b37fad8e5e89de2bff6e5f9bbad.avif?t=1787883415\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE WRITTEN FATE</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Story of Grief… That Refuses to Stay Buried</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daniel was once a man of reason—a paranormal investigator who sought his answers in the unknown.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Until the night he lost his wife, Alisa.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was meant to be just another case became something far more personal… something that shattered his world. Since then, Daniel has lived in the shadow of that haunted not just by spirits, but by guilt.<br>Day-By-Day his conditions worsen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But when a call comes in from a fellow officer about a brutal, unexplainable incident…<br>One that mirrors the very horror that took Alisa—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daniel has no choice but to return.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612730/extras/956339de93acea8dceb6bb18dd8467d4.avif?t=1787883415\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Investigation Begins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What starts inside a seemingly ordinary <strong>murder house</strong> quickly unravels into something far deeper. Whispers echo where no one stands. Shadows move where light should exist. And the dead… refuse to stay silent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Daniel digs deeper, the case pulls him beyond the house—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➡ Into the Unknown</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >➡ Into a cursed forest<br>➡ Down into suffocating caves<br>➡ And toward a truth that was never meant to be uncovered</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not just survival, but also one's confrontation to his written fate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >First-Person Paranormal Investigation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search environments, uncover hidden clues, and piece together a fragmented narrative.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Psychological Horror</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your mind is your greatest enemy. What you see… may not be real.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supernatural Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive the final moments of lost souls and interact with echoes of the past.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Environmental Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock paths, perform rituals, and break through the unknown.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Cinematic Storytelling</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A deeply personal narrative driven by loss, fear, and revelation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612730/extras/61c0cdbeda3a94758639d022c99b5521.avif?t=1787883415\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Journey Through Fear</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From tight corridors of a blood-stained home…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To the Unknown,<br>To the suffocating silence of a deadly forest…<br>To the darkness beneath the earth—</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each location brings you closer to the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And further away from sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Truth About Alisa</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This was never just a case.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It was nits and dots, all connected.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every clue, every vision, every encounter—<br>Leads back to <strong>her</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612730/extras/794b1c65ad99cb22bcb8c81423deb174.avif?t=1787883415\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Will You Find Answers… or Become One?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some stories should remain untold.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some truths should remain buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But Daniel is already too far gone.</p>", "short_description": "A massacre. A past that won’t stay buried. As Daniel, dive into a chilling investigation that spirals into pure horror. Explore, solve, survive—but something is watching. The deeper you go, the lesser you escape.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612730/9185ec75379cfb869d119cb702c38ca235d78678/header.jpg?t=1787883415", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612730/82c7cd8161a5fb648ce02e8f9c867eba09ab6515/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787883415", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612730/82c7cd8161a5fb648ce02e8f9c867eba09ab6515/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787883415", "website": "https://destinednotes.netlify.app/